abstract: |
  Version 2.0 introduces Dheeraj's Constants (universal scaling coefficients V_α = 0.8169, 
  S_β = 0.1191, K_γ = 5.263) and the phenomenon of meta-emergence—precise mathematical 
  laws emerging from emergent structures. Builds upon Version 1.0 (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.18071761) 
  with complete mathematical formalization, convergence proofs, and 5D-9D empirical validation.
